# promise: #300
# A space with no colour (the theme editor's − took the last one) has Arc's colourless theme: the
# purple light half while macOS is light, the dark half while it is dark, live both ways (#300).
# The theme is what the editor saves for an empty pad on Auto, `key` [] included, so the editor
# reopens on "Tap to pick a color for this space". systemAppearance flips only the app.
budget rss=600 stalls50=10
seed settings.json {"hasSeenImportPrompt": true, "toolbarDefaultMigrated": true}
